@startuml fr04-weekly-plan
' Origin: drafted with AI assistance (Claude Code) from FR-04 in docs/02-requirements.md; reviewed by the author.
title FR-04 AI-generated weekly study plan (agentic AI)
|Student|
start
:POST /plans {weekStart, replace};
|Planner|
if (weekStart is a Monday and the week is not over?) then (no)
  :400;
  stop
elseif (has availability slots and topics?) then (no)
  :400 (before any LLM call);
  stop
elseif (week already planned and replace ≠ true?) then (yes)
  :409 "send replace: true";
  stop
else (ok)
endif
:Create empty StudyPlan;
|Planning agent (LLM)|
:Receive goal: plan this week;
repeat
  :Call a tool: getDeadlines, getAvailability,\ngetTopics (with priority), getFocusStats;
  if (getFocusStats?) then (yes)
    |Focus|
    :GET /progress/{userId};
    |Planning agent (LLM)|
  endif
  :Propose blocks with addBlocks(list)\nor reportInsufficientTime(reason);
  |Planner|
  :StudyPlan checks every rule in code:\ninside one slot, 25–90 min, ≥ 10 min gap,\nin this week, not in the past;
  :Accepted blocks are added;\nbroken rules return "REFUSED: …";
  |Planning agent (LLM)|
repeat while (more to plan or refusals to fix?) is (yes)
->no;
:Write the plan summary;
|Planner|
if (LLM failed (quota, network, key)?) then (yes)
  :503, nothing saved;
  stop
else (no)
  :Save StudyPlan with TimeBlocks (PLANNED);
  :201 plan (blocks + rationale, shortfall if any);
endif
stop
@enduml
